wh:site_1063 a wh:WorldHeritageSite ;
    rdfs:label "المشهد الثقافي التاريخي لمنطقة توكاج  المختصّة بزراعة الكرمة"@ar,
        "Tokaj Wine Region Historic Cultural Landscape"@en,
        "Paisaje cultural histórico de la región vitivinícola de Tokay"@es,
        "Paysage culturel historique de la région viticole de Tokaj"@fr,
        "Исторический культурный ландшафт винодельческого района Токай"@ru,
        "托卡伊葡萄酒产地历史文化景观"@zh ;
    wh:areaHectares 13255.0 ;
    wh:belongsToRegion wh:region_EUR ;
    wh:description "The cultural landscape of Tokaj graphically demonstrates the long tradition of wine production in this region of low hills and river valleys. The intricate pattern of vineyards, farms, villages and small towns, with their historic networks of deep wine cellars, illustrates every facet of the production of the famous Tokaj wines, the quality and management of which have been strictly regulated for nearly three centuries."@en ;
    wh:hasCategory wh:category_Cultural ;
