    rdfs:label "الحي التاريخي في مدينة كولونيا دي ساكرامنتو"@ar,
        "Historic Quarter of the City of Colonia del Sacramento"@en,
        "Barrio histórico de la ciudad de Colonia del Sacramento"@es,
        "Quartier historique de la ville de Colonia del Sacramento"@fr,
        "Историческая часть города Колония-дель-Сакраменто"@ru,
        "萨拉门多移民镇的历史区"@zh ;
    wh:areaHectares 19.0 ;
    wh:belongsToRegion wh:region_LAC ;
    wh:description "Founded by the Portuguese in 1680 on the Río de la Plata, the city was of strategic importance in resisting the Spanish. After being disputed for a century, it was finally lost by its founders. The well-preserved urban landscape illustrates the successful fusion of the Portuguese, Spanish and post-colonial styles."@en ;
