wh:site_856 a wh:WorldHeritageSite ;
    rdfs:label "المصاعد الأربعة لقناة الوسط ومحيطها، اللا لوفيير واللورو (هينولت)"@ar,
        "The Four Lifts on the Canal du Centre and their Environs, La Louvière and Le Roeulx (Hainaut)"@en,
        "Los cuatro elevadores del Canal del Centro y sus alrededores, La Louvií¨re y Le Roeulx (Hainault)"@es,
        "Les quatre ascenseurs du canal du Centre et leur site, La Louvière et Le Roeulx (Hainaut)"@fr,
        "Четыре судоподъемника на канале Дю-Сантр и их окружение, Ля-Лувьер и Ле-Рейкс, провинция Эно"@ru,
        "拉卢维耶尔和勒罗尔克斯中央运河上的四座船舶吊车（艾诺）"@zh ;
    wh:areaHectares 67.3436 ;
    wh:belongsToRegion wh:region_EUR ;
    wh:description "The four hydraulic boat-lifts on this short stretch of the historic Canal du Centre are industrial monuments of the highest quality. Together with the canal itself and its associated structures, they constitute a remarkably well-preserved and complete example of a late-19th-century industrial landscape. Of the eight hydraulic boat-lifts built at the end of the 19th and beginning of the 20th century, the only ones in the world which still exist in their original working condition are these four lifts on the Canal du Centre."@en ;
    wh:hasCategory wh:category_Cultural ;
    wh:hasComponent wh:component_856 ;
    wh:hasCriterion wh:criterion_iii,
        wh:criterion_iv ;
    wh:hasImage wh:image_02351ad52a9e906f,
        wh:image_0b70639a4e620a04,
        wh:image_0e765625175b9178,
